    "detailed_description": "<h1>Beta is now live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.poster.avif?t=1752710695\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.webm?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.mp4?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.poster.avif?t=1752710695\" width=678 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.webm?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.mp4?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mega Mash Mons is a multiplayer third person giant monster brawler featuring ground, air, and water battles oriented on quick player versus player matches. Players can fight through campaigns and different game modes with a large roster of playable characters to choose from, battling other player and ai controlled monsters as well as military units and building sized boss monsters, in effort to grow your character stronger than any other player while unlocking a vast and immersive scientifically accurate fiction story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title has been in independent production for only 2 years with analytics being started immediately after the founder of Dotosy\u00ae earned his Bachelors of Science degree in Game Design from Full Sail University. Everything from initial popularity statistics, through all programming to Beta art and polish, has been created solely by the companies founder. No outside assets have been used in the production of this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.poster.avif?t=1752710695\" width=678 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.webm?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.mp4?t=1752710695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mega Mash Mons is a multiplayer third person giant monster brawler featuring ground, air, and water battles oriented on quick player versus player matches. Players can fight through campaigns and different game modes with a large roster of playable characters to choose from, battling other player and ai controlled monsters as well as military units and building sized boss monsters, in effort to grow your character stronger than any other player while unlocking a vast and immersive scientifically accurate fiction story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title has been in independent production for only 2 years with analytics being started immediately after the founder of Dotosy\u00ae earned his Bachelors of Science degree in Game Design from Full Sail University. Everything from initial popularity statistics, through all programming to Beta art and polish, has been created solely by the companies founder. No outside assets have been used in the production of this game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Giant monstrosities fly swim climb and battle on enormous fields to level up to being the strongest creature alive. Master multiple game modes such as depleting respawn reserves, most enemy damage, most environment damage, capture the flag, races, mazes and more to level up and customize your Mons!",
